*> USING CLIENT-STATE, entity id, slot (0 main hand, 1 off hand), item registry id (0 or less: the empty stack), remove-instrument (1: the patch removes component type 63): Set Equipment.
 DATA DIVISION.
 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
 COPY PROTO.
 01 WS-READY               BINARY-LONG VALUE 0.
 01 WS-CAPACITY            BINARY-LONG VALUE 4096.
 01 WS-EQUIP               BINARY-LONG VALUE 104.
 LINKAGE SECTION.
 COPY CLSTATE.
 01 L-ID                   BINARY-LONG.
 01 L-SLOT                 BINARY-LONG.
 01 L-ITEM                 BINARY-LONG.
