     CALL "PB-PUT-ITEM-STACK" USING PB-BUFFER PB-ITEMSTACK-X
     MOVE 0 TO PB-POS
     CALL "ENTITY-PACKET" USING CLIENT-STATE PB-BUFFER WS-EQUIP
